<title>POLAND: BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 0.7 MLN LOSS IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 0.7 MLN LOSS IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.72 vs   0.51 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.72 vs   0.88 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.23 vs   1.37 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    8.43 vs   8.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.51 vs   0.86 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.51 vs   1.57 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.30 vs   3.87 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   31.29 vs  31.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
